Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.08,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 1, 2025 - BC Classic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Final turn - just before the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young is already trying to take the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:08.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:12.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fierceness along the rail, swinging out to close in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:16.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,And on the far outside, last year's champion Sierra Leone is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:20.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young leads - holding on, holding on - Forever Young in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:24.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sierra Leone charging from the outside, closing in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up front, Forever Young and Sierra Leone - side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:34.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,But Forever Young just on the inside - he wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:39.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest dirt race - the Breeders' Cup Classic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forever Young opens a new door for Japanese racing!